-- vendors can correct individual items via the menu diet toggle.
-- ROLLBACK: is_veg cannot be restored to prior NULLs (prior state was
-- uniformly NULL — re-nulling is possible but pointless). To undo,
-- restore from a pre-migration backup (take one before applying).

